    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000358_00044",
      "en_US": [
        "{COLOR 1}Registering a Wii Number{COLOR 0}\n",
        "\n",
        "If your Wii number is registered,\n",
        "when a trade goes through at the\n",
        "GTS, you will be notified of the fact\n",
        "by a Wii message.\n",
        "\n",
        "For details, please refer to the\n",
        "Instruction Booklet.\n",
        "\n",
        "Would you like to register your\n",
        "Wii number?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{COLOR 1}Enregistrer un code Wii{COLOR 0}\n",
        "\n",
        "Si votre code Wii est enregistré, vous\n",
        "recevrez un message Wii chaque fois\n",
        "que vous conclurez un échange à la GTS.\n",
        "\n",
        "Pour plus de détails, veuillez\n",
        "vous référer au mode d’emploi.\n",
        "\n",
        "Voulez-vous enregistrer votre\n",
        "code Wii?"
      ]
